## s8 map
[{"defect_id":"PD-AUTH-001","probe_id":"P6-table-bypass","justification":"anon AND a real authenticated customer bearer selected public.customers directly while it held two live rows, against a service_role control proving the rows existed; both read 0."},{"defect_id":"PD-AUTH-002","probe_id":"P2-document-scope","justification":"NOT DISCRIMINATED (D44). The probe compared supplier A's own documents response with the response to the same call naming supplier B's id and found them byte-identical. supplier_portal takes no owner id from the body, so an identical body is the only possible answer and answers nothing about the defect; both fixtures also held zero documents."},{"defect_id":"PD-AUTH-003","probe_id":"P5-non-admin-mutation","justification":"a real customer bearer attempted an admin mutation on os_api and was refused 403."},{"defect_id":"PD-AUTH-004","probe_id":"P5-no-role-readonly","justification":"an authenticated identity resolving to no active canonical role was refused 403 by the Command Center."},{"defect_id":"PD-FILE-001","probe_id":"P8-mime-allowlist","justification":"a ZIP declared application/zip and named .pdf was refused by the bucket MIME allow-list, which storage enforces regardless of the uploading code path."},{"defect_id":"PD-FILE-002","probe_id":"P8-size-limit","justification":"an upload over the bucket's declared file_size_limit was refused 413 by storage itself."},{"defect_id":"PD-FILE-003","probe_id":"P8-executable-content","justification":"an MZ executable declared application/x-msdownload was refused 415 invalid_mime_type."},{"defect_id":"PD-FILE-004","probe_id":"P7-expired-url","justification":"a signed URL was minted with a 1 second TTL, replayed successfully while valid, and refused after expiry."},{"defect_id":"PD-FILE-005","probe_id":"P7-unowned-insert","justification":"an authenticated customer bearer inserted directly into storage.objects under a path it does not own and was refused."},{"defect_id":"PD-PRIV-003","probe_id":"P7-wrong-owner-path","justification":"a customer bearer and an anonymous caller each named a private bucket path belonging to another party on the two minters that accept a caller-supplied path; both were refused."},{"defect_id":"PD-PRIV-004","probe_id":"P3-supplier-surface-body","justification":"NOT DISCRIMINATED (D44). A real supplier bearer called supplier_api inbox, supplier_portal opportunities and /rest/v1/inquiries and the response bodies were scanned for the two known customer identities; none appeared. With 0 inquiries, 0 customers and 0 inquiry_matches on the estate there was no identity to find, so the scan proves the surfaces are empty, not that a populated payload is masked."}]
